  "summary": "In C8 the mask comes from comparing each sea cell's 2019-06-01..08-31 SST with a smoothed threshold indexed by strftime day of year (152-243). The threshold for each day of year is a scalar nanpercentile pooled over all region cells and over baseline dates sharing that strftime day of year, with no \u00b15-day window. The 31-day wrap smoothing therefore pulls in baseline pools for days 137-258, which is May 16/17 to Sep 14/15 depending on leap year.  All of it is written via C8:L381."
